        openings: ("{V}, a five-month-old, was fine at drop-off and had a swollen leg at pickup. A scan showed a fracture the doctors say does not fit a fall from a mat. {D} was the day care worker alone with {V}, and the State will show you why that matters.", "A slip off a mat. It sounds small, and a second pediatrician will tell you it can break a leg. {D} told the parents {V} was fussy and never hid anything."),
        closings: ("A fracture that does not fit a short slip, a worker alone with the baby, and a delay of hours before anyone called. {V} was hurt in {D}'s care.", "A slip, a twist, and a fracture, with an expert who says it can happen. The State has not proved {D} hurt {V} on purpose."),
        timeline: [(0, "8 a.m.: drop-off."), (0, "1 p.m.: the fall, {DL} says."), (0, "5 p.m.: pickup."), (0, "7 p.m.: the scan.")],
