        defense: [E(.statement, 1, "Faulty Counters", "{DL} says the older counters read high."), E(.document, 1, "Repair Orders", "Two counters repaired in the period.")],
        role: "Parking authority supervisor",
        exam: [.direct("What did your review of {D}'s collection route find?", "\"Deposits $23,000 below what the meter counters recorded over eighteen months. The gap is on {D}'s route only.\""), .direct("What did the truck GPS logs show about the defendant's stops?", "\"Stops at a coin dealer on collection days. {D.He} had been told about the GPS tracking a month before those stops.\""), .direct("What did the coin dealer's records show about the defendant?", "\"Weekly coin sales by {DL}. The dealer's receipts are in evidence, and they line up with the collection days.\""), .direct("Tell us about your job at the parking authority.", "\"I supervise the collection crew for the parking authority. I review deposits against the meter counters, and I check routes and trucks for problems.\""), .direct("Did the other routes show the same gap?", "\"No. The other routes matched their meter counts within a few dollars.\""), .direct("What did the truck GPS logs add to your review?", "\"They showed stops at a coin dealer on collection days. The dealer's records listed weekly coin sales by {DL}, which matched the days of the gap.\""), .cross("{D} says the counters on older meters read high, doesn't {D.he}?", "\"Yes. Older counters can read high, and I agree with that. But they read high on every collector's route.\""), .cross("Did any other collector on the authority have a gap like this?", "\"No. {D.He} was the only collector with a gap, and the others matched their counters closely.\""), .cross("Did anyone see the defendant take coins out of a meter for personal use?", "\"No. No one saw that. We have counters, deposits, the GPS logs, and the dealer's receipts.\""), .cross("Could the older counters have been reading high?", "\"Possibly. Two counters were repaired during that time. But the gap appeared only on {D.his} route, which a faulty counter would not explain.\""), .cross("Did the defendant know about the GPS tracking?", "\"{D.He} was told about the tracking a month before