obby stop would be a problem.\"")],
        openings: ("A parking authority's coin collector, {D}, deposited $23,000 less than the meter counters recorded over eighteen months. Truck GPS logs show stops at a coin dealer on collection days, and the dealer's records list weekly sales by {DL}.", "By the end of this trial, the proof will show that older counters read high, that {D} sold coins from a personal collection, and that no one saw {DL} take anything."),
